===Etymology===
{{suffix|fierce|ly}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en-us-fiercely.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Adverb===
{{head|en|adverb}}

# In a [[fierce#Adjective|fierce]] manner.
#: {{usex|lang=en|The wind blew '''fiercely''' and the rain fell heavily.}}
#*{{quote-book|year=1879|author={{w|Richard Jefferies}}|title=[http://gutenberg.org/ebooks/13730 The Amateur Poacher]|chapter=1
|passage=They burned the old gun that used to stand in the dark corner up in the garret, close to the stuffed fox that always grinned so '''fiercely'''. Perhaps the reason why he seemed in such a ghastly rage was that he did not come by his death fairly.}}

